格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A Fluent Windows 11 desktop shell for the official DeepSeek Harness WebUI.","id":"gh:1334437230","install_available":false,"language":"C#","name":"LocalWhale","slug":"penglai-doll/LocalWhale","topics":["deepseek-harness","dotnet","dsh-plugin","local-ai","webview2","windows-11","winui3"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A Fluent Windows 11 desktop shell for the official DeepSeek Harness WebUI."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **项目已归档 · 停止维护（2026-09-30）**\n>\n> 官方 **DeepSeek Harness Desktop（dsh-desktop）** 已推出，L"},{"id":"p2s2","text":"ocalWhale 为 DSH 提供桌面宿主的历史使命已经完成。本仓库停止维护，不再发布更新或修复；代码、文档和历史版本保留，供学习与参考。\n>\n> 请转向 DeepSeek Harness 官方入口"},{"id":"p2s3","text":"；官方桌面端源码与说明见 deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness/apps/desktop。感谢所有使用、反馈和支持 LocalWhale 的朋友。\n>\n> **Archived ·"},{"id":"p2s4","text":" No longer maintained (2026-09-30)**\n>\n> The official **DeepSeek Harness Desktop (dsh-desktop)** is "},{"id":"p2s5","text":"now available, and LocalWhale has fulfilled its purpose as a desktop host for DSH. This repository i"},{"id":"p2s6","text":"s no longer maintained and will receive no further updates or fixes. Its code, documentation, and pa"},{"id":"p2s7","text":"st releases remain available for learning and reference.\n>\n> Please use the official DeepSeek Harnes"},{"id":"p2s8","text":"s page. The official desktop source and documentation are available in deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness/"},{"id":"p2s9","text":"apps/desktop. Thank you to everyone who used, tested, and supported LocalWhale."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"LocalWhale"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"用 WinUI 3 把 DeepSeek Harness 带到 Windows 桌面。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"A native WinUI 3 desktop home for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"平台版本 / Platform editions"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Windows（本仓库）v0.1.3\n· macOS 0.1.0-preview.1"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"下载最新版 / Download\n· v0.1.5 更新日志 / Release notes\n· DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"LocalWhale 是一个基于 **.NET 10、WinUI 3 和 Windows App SDK** 的原生 Windows 11 桌面宿主。运行 `LocalWhale.exe` 后，它会隐"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"藏启动随包携带的 Node/Harness 服务，通过带鉴权的健康检查确认就绪，再由 WebView2 显示未修改的官方 WebUI。"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 中文说明"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 为什么做 LocalWhale"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"官方 Harness 提供的是本地 WebUI，直接使用时通常需要自己管理 Node、包管理器、终端窗口、端口和服务退出。LocalWhale 把这些“启动器日常任务”收进一个原生 WinUI 3 本"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"rness 提供的是本地 WebUI，直接使用时通常需要自己管理 Node、包管理器、终端窗口、端口和服务退出。LocalWhale 把这些“启动器日常任务”收进一个原生 WinUI 3 本地客户端："},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **WinUI 3 原生桌面体验：** 使用 Windows App SDK `TitleBar`、Mica、Fluent 控件、系统窗口按钮、Snap 和高 DPI 命中区。\n- **双击 EX"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"E 即用：** 不要求系统已安装 Node、pnpm 或 .NET Runtime。\n- **遵循官方插件架构：** desktop bridge 通过 `--patch` 作为 Cordis 插件加"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"载；仓库按照官方建议使用 `dsh-plugin` topic。\n- 后台服务不弹终端窗口；随机监听 `127.0.0.1` 端口，不暴露到局域网。\n- EXE、任务栏、Alt+Tab、托盘和安装器统"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"一使用简洁的 LocalWhale 鲸尾图标。\n- 默认保持克制的 Fluent 外观，也可以从标题栏菜单切换到鲸鱼娘主题。\n- WebView2 直接加载官方 Harness 页面，宿主不修改官方前"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"端。\n- 默认关闭窗口即完全退出；可切换为关闭到系统托盘。\n- 退出时优先请求 Harness 优雅关闭，超时后由 Job Object 清理整棵子进程树。\n- Harness 与本地客户端独立版本管"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"理，候选 Harness 更新需先通过隔离冒烟测试。\n- 首次创建官方 profile 时若遇到已知的模块链接竞态，LocalWhale 会保留诊断并仅自动重试一次。"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 下载与安装"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"支持范围：**Windows 11 x64**。"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. 打开本仓库的 **Releases** 页面。\n2. 下载 `LocalWhale-Setup-x64.exe`，可同时下载 `SHA256SUMS.txt` 校验文件。\n3. 运行标准安装向导"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"。安装目录页始终显示，可选择任意有写入权限的位置；默认目录为 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\LocalWhale`。\n4. 可选创建桌面快捷方式，安装完成后启动 LocalWhal"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"装目录页始终显示，可选择任意有写入权限的位置；默认目录为 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\LocalWhale`。\n4. 可选创建桌面快捷方式，安装完成后启动 LocalWhale。"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"安装器是按用户安装，不请求管理员权限；Node 24、pnpm、Harness、WinUI 运行文件和 WebView2 Evergreen 离线安装器都已随包携带。首个个人发布版本未进行商业代码签名"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"，因此 Windows 可能显示“未知发布者”提示，请只从本仓库 Release 下载并核对 SHA-256。"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 外观与主题"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### 启动与退出流程"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"bridge 只增加两个本机宿主端点："},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- `GET /__localwhale/v1/health`\n- `POST /__localwhale/v1/shutdown`"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"它们要求每次启动随机生成、仅驻留内存的 `X-LocalWhale-Token`。端口、PID 和 token 都不会写入磁盘。"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### What LocalWhale provides"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"LocalWhale packages the official DeepSeek Harness WebUI as a native Windows 11 x64 desktop experienc"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"calWhale packages the official DeepSeek Harness WebUI as a native Windows 11 x64 desktop experience:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- a native WinUI 3 and Windows App SDK shell with `TitleBar`, Mica, Fluent controls, Snap, tray inte"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"gration, and high-DPI behavior;\n- a Cordis desktop bridge loaded through the official Harness `--pat"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ch` plugin mechanism; this repository follows the upstream recommendation to use the `dsh-plugin` to"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"pic;\n- one simple LocalWhale mark across the executable, taskbar, Alt+Tab, tray, and installer;\n- an"},{"id":"p28s5","text":" Original theme by default plus an optional WhaleGirl host theme;\n- WebView2 hosting without CSS inj"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"ection, iframe wrapping, or upstream UI changes;\n- bundled Node, pnpm, Harness, and an offline WebVi"},{"id":"p28s7","text":"ew2 installer;\n- hidden service startup on a random loopback port;\n- per-launch token authentication"},{"id":"p28s8","text":" for the desktop health/shutdown bridge;\n- graceful shutdown followed by Job Object process-tree cle"},{"id":"p28s9","text":"anup;\n- single-instance activation, optional tray behavior, redacted rotating logs;\n- isolated valid"},{"id":"p28s10","text":"ation and rollback protection for Harness updates;\n- one bounded retry for the upstream first-profil"},{"id":"p28s11","text":"e module-link race;\n- a dedicated Harness restart button plus a native settings dialog for close-to-"},{"id":"p28s12","text":"tray, themes, update checks, and logs;\n- shell self-update: GitHub release checks (24h, toggleable),"},{"id":"p28s13","text":" click-to-download with byte-level SHA-256 verification, and a silent reinstall on the next launch t"},{"id":"p28s14","text":"hat relaunches the updated shell."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Privacy and local data"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Official Harness data remains in `%USERPROFILE%\\.dsh`; LocalWhale never removes it during uninstall."},{"id":"p30s2","text":" Shell settings, runtime packages, WebView2 data, staging files, and redacted logs live under `%LOCA"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"LAPPDATA%\\LocalWhale` and are removed by the uninstaller. Bridge tokens, ports, and PIDs are memory-"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ATA%\\LocalWhale` and are removed by the uninstaller. Bridge tokens, ports, and PIDs are memory-only."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

